    description: "The unofficial national dish of the Philippines. Bone-in chicken thighs braise in a sharp, glossy sauce of soy, vinegar, garlic, bay, and black pepper. The trick is to let the vinegar simmer without stirring until its raw bite is gone, then reduce the sauce to a sticky glaze. Serve over rice.",
