      "Make-ahead. Cooked slices hold in a low oven (90 C) on a rack for up to 20 minutes without losing texture. The custard can be whisked the night before and kept covered in the fridge. Do not soak the bread ahead.",
      "Serve with maple syrup as the default. Fresh berries and lightly whipped cream lean dessert; crisp bacon on the side leans brunch. Powdered sugar dusted just before serving is the visual signature.",
