    description: "The Ensenada original: white fish in a thin beer batter, fried hard, tucked into warm corn tortillas with shredded cabbage, a tangy mayo-and-sour-cream sauce, pickled onions, and salsa. Crisp, cold, hot, and acidic all at once — the four-corner balance is the whole point.",
